皇敘事分段，降秦趙王與鉅鹿趙王分候選。周召引功與呂望保存引古，不補周召全名；應侯、春申君及魏公子不從記憶補名。王翦王賁王離依明示分存，孫不推出父親；將軍受話按李信與王翦對話範圍辨認。王氏蒙氏及匿名說話者未全域接個別人物。","surfaces":["魏王"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p009","quote":"王翦者，頻陽東鄉人也。少而好兵，事秦始皇。始皇十一年，翦將攻趙閼與，破之，拔九城，十八年，翦將攻趙。歲餘，遂拔趙，趙王降，盡定趙地為郡。明年，燕使荊軻為賊於秦，秦王使王翦攻燕。燕王喜走遼東，翦遂定燕薊而還。秦使翦子王賁擊荊，荊兵敗。還擊魏，魏王降，遂定魏地。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p009","text":"王翦者，頻陽東鄉人也。少而好兵，事秦始皇。始皇十一年，翦將攻趙閼與，破之，拔九城，十八年，翦將攻趙。歲餘，遂拔趙，趙王降，盡定趙地為郡。明年，燕使荊軻為賊於秦，秦王使王翦攻燕。燕王喜走遼東，翦遂定燕薊而還。秦使翦子王賁擊荊，荊兵敗。還擊魏，魏王降，遂定魏地。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"twz_p17_9b4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"秦始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"q3n_t18_zql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"q3n_t18_zql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"翦","kind":"person","person_id":"twz_p17_9b4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"翦","kind":"person","person_id":"twz_p17_9b4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"4tq_wkd_83s","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"frs_icw_4ma","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"q3n_t18_zql","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m009-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"twz_p17_9b4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-ba